  <activityDataset>
    <activityDescription>
      <activity id="f7a15a28-414d-5b20-b7e6-5fdf8bf16553" activityNameId="1795cd53-2603-596d-a9e5-d90f9d783411" activityNameContextId="f44c43c1-5cc5-54a6-ade6-24435bd12c83" type="1" specialActivityType="0" energyValues="0">
        <activityName xml:lang="en">Inverter, 10 kW, average, at plant</activityName>
        <generalComment>
          <text xml:lang="en" index="1">Full activity name: Inverter, 10 kW, average, at plant
Production of an average inverter (10 kW) for photovoltaic plant. Total weight about 28.9 kg. The printed wiring board weighs 0.8 kg and the printed wiring board assembly (total) 3.1 kg. Average calculated with data from three leading European manufacturers and extrapolated to the power scale of interest.;
UUID: 596c29ef-da3b-3425-8e2d-8f03223a9441
Materials, packaging and electricity use for the production of an average inverter. Disposal of the product after use (metals and the printed wiring board are assumed to be recycled).
Location: Production in RER.
Technology: Inverter for a photovoltaic grid-connected system with a capacity of 10kWp.
Time period: undefined
Production volume: na
Sampling: Survey at inverter manufacturers. 
Extrapolations: Data for inverters of different output power converted to a common output of 10kW using a power law.
Uncertainty adjustments: None
BAFU mapped export: unsupported biosphere exchanges excluded; see audit/. Local UUIDs and generic activity classification are export conventions. Source: process_596c29ef-da3b-3425-8e2d-8f03223a9441.xml</text>
        </generalComment>
      </activity>
      <geography geographyId="20a9bf48-6cea-59b4-ad08-000cb981f2d0" geographyContextId="f44c43c1-5cc5-54a6-ade6-24435bd12c83">
